{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "946230d27ab59728d79cee3215a16bf37c9481efca81e16d181f4e89125bd5a2", "ja": "愛は波間に揺れて……", "zh": "爱在波浪间摇曳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bcae43477b3709d368899b3e3d9da22a0d2304aa2f02f4a23f94810b8899aa24", "ja": "練習後、一緒に帰る事になった志保と琴葉。\n話の流れで、歌織の宿題の事を相談する志保\nに、琴葉は自分なりのミュージカルへの向き\n合い方を話す。そして不意に、通りかかった\n公園で、ボートに乗ろうと誘うのだった。", "zh": "练习结束后，志保和琴叶决定一起回去。\n志保聊到歌织的作业，向琴叶征求意见，\n琴叶便说起了自己面对音乐剧的方式。\n随后，她突然邀请路过公园的志保\n一起去划船。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "95b04860fb320ce06a79a5af720108ce6009cec47f22bcc231af2bcda4de4c02", "ja": "（ミュージカル公演に向けて、日々練習が続いている。\n今日のレッスンはここまでだけど……）", "zh": "（为了音乐剧公演，每天都在持续练习。\n今天的课程就到这里了，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "2335406bd6f5e2fdf2b457601e9c001783f29c242039dec941375e3a0c9584bf", "ja": "志保ちゃん、今日は一緒に帰らない？　同じ\nユニットになってから、まだあまり話せてないから。", "zh": "志保，今天要不要一起回去？自从成为同一个组合以来，我们还没怎么聊过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "bc2aede30c6fa49107bc1b23f1c7d10745884c5c4d306ae185c4424431911651", "ja": "琴葉さん。私は、かまいませんけど……。", "zh": "琴叶。我倒是没关系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "4d066a754c6fb844b202374087d4d2ba6f494c181d36465a2ebeb3eabecaca43", "ja": "よかった！　それじゃ、{$P$}。\nお疲れさまでした。", "zh": "太好了！那就，{$P$}。\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "7b4cbdcd7ae7d6ec677cb963e6e8b9dfc84c12b42da7dc009f6c1e988451cac9", "ja": "お疲れさまでした。", "zh": "辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "170403ec9a9423d14748bdcb86ec6e9b789776219f8e49c5e0e5d7b37ed7272a", "ja": "ああ。ふたりとも、気をつけて！", "zh": "啊。你们两个，路上小心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b3417abfa78c8f7dbae1ce484fda44a6f3d4b1a9a1aa836b059b9c1078067dec", "ja": "（琴葉と志保か……確かに珍しい組み合わせかな。\nユニットを組むと、人間関係が広がるのがいい所だな）", "zh": "（琴叶和志保吗……确实是个少见的组合啊。组成组合后，人际关系也会变得更广，这就是好处啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a007cc5fe75a818f33e9ab20dd9acdbc59eab84dece51cf94040862991fae21b", "ja": "あのふたりだと、どんな話をするのかな……\n後で、それとなく聞いてみよう。", "zh": "她们两个人在一起，会聊些什么呢……\n待会儿暗中打听一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "ba6c13a00871e0d3eced1bf89920197deca47a9461f0456d5c895dd51a722328", "ja": "志保ちゃんは、最近どう？\nお芝居について、悩んでることはない？", "zh": "志保，你最近怎么样？\n关于演戏，有什么烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "30ad57d91d11d9797eb261277afec1a23f96dcc046e203d10ece7d8d969816d7", "ja": "……本当にみんな、私のこと妹扱いするんですね。", "zh": "……大家还真都把我当妹妹看待呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "31772f37e06b5c4c7a8d7ef3d7f17ccb4f7e2c50b3efc231824a03ef641e84e9", "ja": "えっ？　ああ、ごめんね。\n気に障ったかな。", "zh": "诶？啊，对不起。\n是不是让你觉得不舒服了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "bf376d1a87e9b54609016e6df1c2ebd1a9dd603fd407eacda5fced9011a52bf9", "ja": "いえ。……気がかりで当然だと思います。\n主演の私がしっかりしないと、みんな困るでしょうし。", "zh": "不是……我觉得你会担心也是理所当然的。\n毕竟，如果作为主演的我不可靠，大家都会很困扰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "12d0d701844f33098c4256b6c6d7ce1cae141bcdef478203f8690eeea6c415ac", "ja": "悩んでいる、というほどではないんですが……\nここ最近、ずっと考えていることならあります。", "zh": "虽然还没到烦恼的程度……但最近确实一直在思考一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "5c0e3ed31720dcdc3bd1940a17d31d381cc5306c9e65da12d50e66a8c6ee0483", "ja": "そうなんだ。\n何について考えてるのか、聞いてもいい？", "zh": "这样啊。\n可以问问你在思考什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "a7082ec02bb7ee17c3767ed117c55fa948390a2870d8304dfc251b0ae5b59eec", "ja": "はい。ミュージカルの登場人物は、\nなぜ、歌い始めるのかについてです。", "zh": "是的。我在思考音乐剧中的人物为什么会开始唱歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "e781ba96e4d3eb125c8c0d7fc09261fb057a4f87ab0fe2b4c37278f7bf8cdb5b", "ja": "歌織さんに、考えてみてと言われたんです。\nでも、なんだかしっくりくる答えが見つからなくて。", "zh": "歌织让我好好想想。\n可是，总觉得找不到一个令人信服的答案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "08f2902d07cc4f6aca4cb0458a4d3065a22f3b5df9a8a94b26c71fca618bf543", "ja": "それは……ミュージカルができた歴史的な過程を\n勉強しなさい、ということじゃないんだよね？", "zh": "那就是说……不是要我去学习音乐剧诞生的历史过程，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "b8745311d7d99bfdd1779635de2e7d635d7951a086feca107a6d31ed6956073e", "ja": "ええ。最初、そういうことも調べてみたんです。\nオペラが、今のミュージカルになるまでの歴史だとか。", "zh": "是的。起初我也调查过那些内容。\n比如歌剧发展成如今音乐剧的历史。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "88928cda0c2973b654fbd05a589f5410e74ffa952165178e506c4ed8ac0c5e90", "ja": "ただ、歌織さんが言っていたのは、\nそういうニュアンスじゃなかったように思います。", "zh": "不过，我觉得歌织所说的，并不是那种意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "d27af28c937af003857d2775a108505d220a0d218f66d67b5cfc2a41d9fa7c34", "ja": "そっか……。だったら、私にもわからないことかな。\nごめんね、力になれなくて。", "zh": "这样啊……那样的话，可能连我也不明白吧。\n对不起，没能帮上忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "6bd626f8883292133de02df611f30f9a65e6ffcdbe10b433971d5b8127be588d", "ja": "でも、正直に言えば、私もたまに戸惑うんだ。\nどうやって演技から歌にもっていけばいいのかなって。", "zh": "不过，说实话，我有时也会感到困惑。\n该怎样从演技转换到歌唱呢……；", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "540c84a0e724946417c0545d25d5b27a99e4a59d1ad8cd05e2ee7fc5b81e45ae", "ja": "琴葉さんも……？　あの、そういう時は、\nどんなふうに解決してるんですか？", "zh": "琴叶也……？那个，遇到这种时候，你是怎么解决的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "6bb8a5260f0a6527287130c83569e8282181ec00c3244edbb400344796eafb48", "ja": "うん。わからないから、自分にできることを精いっぱい\nやってるかな。……まずは、役になりきること。", "zh": "嗯。正因为不知道，所以我大概会拼尽全力\n去做好自己能做的事吧。……首先，就是彻底融入角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "a02b3afa183a786da03aeb5d0b11e2d9e3ce0885d26cdfc7a61614ccfbbdbafb", "ja": "私の演じる彼が、どんな人生を辿ってきて、\nどんなふうに物事を考えるのか……。", "zh": "我所饰演的他，究竟经历了怎样的人生，\n又会以怎样的方式思考事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "556ea7e15cc9b7b4c1e514aa94c56729b383e64eba21bbf0c697e5ad2d370c8b", "ja": "そして、どんなふうに人を愛するのか……\n今回の役でも、しっかり考えていかなくちゃ。", "zh": "以及他会怎样去爱一个人……\n这次的角色也必须好好思考才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "5b0352e2a3af83ebd40b0c24801e105ce0f33e0ac7e11e77764a8d7d62956f16", "ja": "愛……ですか……。", "zh": "爱……吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1026_017kth", "source_sha256": "e36b3f27e58089fad3349f2bdee7b16a9f13b6fdb97b9e87d36652d0f6438c40", "ja": "あっ、そうだ！　志保ちゃん。\nそこの公園で、ボートに乗っていかない？", "zh": "啊，对了！志保。\n要不要去那边的公园划船？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "5c55e962ccc5de7cd9e8498bcb508a21bf09bfa20f45745fc09e4aac0fe6f5bb", "ja": "は……え？\nどうしたんですか、突然……。", "zh": "啊……咦？\n您怎么突然……这是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "52902ebcf4bd3b0040e67a6e0fa21ecfeaf217fe928b2c59a523248cd63d6ea4", "ja": "考えてみたの。自分が想いを寄せる令嬢に対して、\n彼なら、どんな行動に出るかなって。", "zh": "我就在想，面对自己倾慕的千金小姐，他会采取什么样的行动呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1029_017kth", "source_sha256": "bec094074dc3096e27a36e9bd18bbdc5364496411bab6c4c8d4cc2b5b2adf998", "ja": "つまり、役作り……ってことになるのかな？　だから、\n私にエスコートさせてね。ボートも私が漕ぐから。", "zh": "也就是说，这是在塑造角色……对吧？所以，让我来护送你吧。船也由我来划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "9cc1089e98f5a4ea14c409238a2ee01da6e33599e5fe81a07ca51f01730ccfd6", "ja": "まあ……かまいませんけど……。", "zh": "好吧……我倒是不介意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "d4a21fe270e6ef98524c689096bb42e29516e0c83b5572c7cd456d5a2ffd9202", "ja": "ふふ。やっぱり、妹扱い……\nううん、『姫扱い』は、イヤかな？", "zh": "呵呵。果然还是把我当妹妹看待……\n不，我是说，被当成“公主”对待……你会不喜欢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "4affe147d453ee64402ca6e8696525d5a188f173ec0ee692a6b0f50f09103e52", "ja": "みなさんの役作りに必要なんだとしたら、\n私も、するなとは言えませんし。", "zh": "如果这是大家塑造角色所需要的，我也不能说不要这样做。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1033_033sih", "source_sha256": "44ecb075ff43a28c0e94bfb5332ffb9c993f7e12d60bba8028883d0530c5fec0", "ja": "ただ、過剰に甘やかされるのは、ちょっと。\nそこまで子どもじゃありませんし。", "zh": "不过，被过分宠溺的话，还是有点……\n我也没那么孩子气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1034_017kth", "source_sha256": "56ea51a378fdec2130cdbf62c9bdcbff7075c147c0564f55618a62848ac8229b", "ja": "うん。……きっと、そんな志保ちゃんだから、\nみんな優しくしてあげたいって思うんじゃないかな。", "zh": "嗯。……不过我想，正因为是这样的志保，\n大家才会想要对你好一点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1035_033sih", "source_sha256": "5a0aebeabd89f9da3377fa678135a1ee8103e9e381e8948beff4b8f2de80ee1a", "ja": "そうなんですか？　……よくわかりませんけど。", "zh": "是这样吗？……我不太明白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1036_017kth", "source_sha256": "d51d5cdf3fc78915a316ea027e9a849c268cc5645135b65d81d3a3afdc211044", "ja": "つまり……どんなことにも真剣な志保ちゃんは、\nとても魅力的だってこと……かな？", "zh": "也就是说……对任何事情都认真的志保，很有魅力……是这个意思吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_03_1037_017kth", "source_sha256": "a2f427bb95050c3b9cb9fc41da6f2161b920750ebb969947629d98dc0ccc1e1b", "ja": "なんて、少ししゃべりすぎちゃったね。\n志保ちゃん、ボート、乗りに行こう！", "zh": "瞧我说的，都有点说太多了呢。志保，我们去坐船吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
